          </summary>
          <div class="panel-content">
            <ul>
                  <li>The structure and behavior of physical reality</li>
                  <li>The development and limits of scientific models</li>
                  <li>The role of measurement, instrumentation, and error</li>
                  <li>The boundary between established science and emerging hypotheses</li>
                  <li>The reproducibility of experimental results</li>
                  <li>The relationship between theory and observation</li>
                  <li>The history and evolution of scientific paradigms</li>
                  <li>The influence of funding, institutions, and consensus on research directions</li>
                  <li>The integration of interdisciplinary knowledge</li>
            </ul>
